  "description": "Fast HTML to Markdown converter for .NET 9/10/11, built on z3l.FastHtmlParser: 10–20x faster than ReverseMarkdown and Html2Markdown on typical pages, with 37–62x less memory. Headings, nested lists, links and images (absolute with a page URL), GitHub tables with colspan and rowspan, code blocks with their language, task lists, quotes. Text is escaped only where Markdown needs it; linear time on any markup.",
